{
 "id": 1190992,
 "titulo": "v420 Update Details (Updated)",
 "fecha": 1530527460682,
 "modificada": 1732668139607,
 "url": "https://forum.netmarble.com/futurefight_en/view/2196/1190992",
 "html": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">Greetings, Agents!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">The v420 update featuring Marvel’s <em>Ant-Man and The Wasp</em> is here. Content includes three new Characters and four new Uniforms!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">A new Legendary Battle inspired by Marvel’s <em>Ant-Man and The Wasp</em> has been added!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">That is not all. Thor and Ant-Man will now have the ability advance to Tier-3. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">Alongside these significant updates, v420 will feature new stage for World Boss – Ultimate difficulty, as well as improved Alliance mode, Uniform room and Store.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">You can read more details regarding the update below.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\">To help kick things off, check out the video of Ant-Man and The Wasp in action!</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"youtube_thumb\" data-video-key=\"_nt4bxSNwEA\" height=\"auto\" id=\"1588934226962\" src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/_nt4bxSNwEA/sddefault.jpg\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Three New Characters</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">New characters have been added to the game: </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Ghost, Wasp (Nadia van Dyne), and Goliath</span></p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/WaspSkill01.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/GhostSkill01.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/golskill01.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\"> The Wasp (Nadia van Dyne) and Ghost can be acquired through the ‘Get 20 Biometrics daily’ package, while Goliath is found via Biometric Selector, Hero Chest and Legendary Battle: Marvel’s <em>Ant-Man and The Wasp</em>’s Extreme mode reward.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> 4 New Uniforms</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">New uniforms inspired by MARVEL’S <em>Ant-Man and The Wasp</em>&nbsp;have been added:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Ant-man, Wasp, and Ghost.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Also added: a new uniform for Giant Man.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/antUni02.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/WaspUni01.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/GhostUni01.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/022032/Ult01.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/123.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\"> New uniforms will be on sale for a limited time. Find them at the Marvel Universe / Uniform Room in the Shop.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: red; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> New Legendary Battle </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Enter the world of Ant-Man and The Wasp in a new Legendary Battle based on MARVEL’S <em>Ant-Man and The Wasp</em>.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/321.png\" style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0070c0;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">There are two difficulty levels available on this Legendary Battle: Normal and Extreme. Beware, the Extreme mode is named Extreme for a reason.</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\"> Extreme difficulty will be available by purchasing the LEGENDARY BATTLE: Ant-Man and The Wasp-EXTREME package (2,500 Crystals).</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #ff0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">※&nbsp;You can also purchase 6★ Ghost (no Mastery) + 2,000,000 Gold for 2,500 Crystals instantly via our Special Offers pop-up.</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">[5/8 10:31 a.m. (UTC+0) / 5/8 3:31 a.m. (PDT) added]<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode will unlock immediately upon purchase and cannot be refunded.<br>\n- Legendary Battle Extreme Mode can be used continuously after purchase.</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">New Tier-3 Characters</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Ant-Man and Thor can now reach their full potential by reaching Tier-3 on this update. Reaching Tier-3 guarantees a significant increase in power and effectiveness, as well as unlocking a new Tier-3-only skill! </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://giant.gfycat.com/FeminineGlitteringGalapagostortoise.gif\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://giant.gfycat.com/VacantNiftyAmethystinepython.gif\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">New Character Potentials</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">With this update, you can raise the level of Wasp, Giant-Man, Black Panther, Ant-Man, Hulk, Loki, and Ghost to level 70 by unlocking their Potential.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/Potential.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> New Stages for World Boss Ultimate</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">New challenges await as Ebony Maw’s World Boss: Ultimate is unlocked.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/abc.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Clear the Ultimate mode against Ebony Maw to earn Titan’s Record: Universal!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"line-height: 107%; color: red;\"> Titan’s Record: Universal is essential for upgrading a Universal Characters to Tier-3.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">New Game Mode, Alliance Raid and Alliance Improvements</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">1. Alliance Raid</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">Work together to defeat the Raid Boss and earn Alliance Rewards depending on your scores. </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/cdd.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-Alliance Raid can be activated by the Alliance Leader or Class 1 members using Alliance Points!</span></strong></span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">※</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\">Alliance Raid rewards will be reset every day at 3:00 PM (UTC+0) / 8:00 AM (PDT).</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/cff.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">1. </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">Deal damage to the Raid Boss when all Alliance members succeed in Raids and gather completion points.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">2. </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">After activating the Raid, it can be accessed for a limited period of time, but a new Raid can be started at the end of each time limit.</span></strong><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\"> The Alliance Raid cannot be entered after the time limit.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">3. </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">The Alliance Raid consists of three difficulties: Easy, Normal, and Hard.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\">※</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red;\"> Only characters that meet the requirements can participate in the Alliance Raid.<br>\n<!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\n<!--[endif]--></span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/1234.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: red;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c3.img.netmarble.kr/web/6N/2018/07/021917/12345.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">- Alliance Raid has both completion and All Alliance rewards.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">- Completion rewards are given for successful Raids.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; tab-stops: 396.75pt; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">- All Alliance rewards will be given to all Alliance members when the total accumulated points reach a certain amount from Raids.</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Rewards may vary based on the difficulty level of the Raid, and they can only be obtained once per day until server reset. </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: red; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">※</span><span style=\"color: red; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"> <span lang=\"EN-US\">All Alliance rewards can be claimed at the end of the Raid by entering the Alliance Raid menu screen and pressing the chest icon. The rewards will be sent to the Inbox</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: red; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">.</span> </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">2. Alliance Attendance</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">Help your Alliance grow by simply checking in! </span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportAnnotations]--> </span>\n\n<div>\n<div class=\"msocomtxt\" id=\"_com_1\">\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/fds.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-The higher the Alliance Attendance, the easier it is to raise the level of your Alliance and Alliance Shop level. </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> S.H.I.E.L.D. Lab Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">1. Warp Device</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">Mission grades are now shown on the dispatch screen.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/654.png\" style=\"font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 나눔고딕; mso-bidi-font-family: 굴림; color: #0075c8;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">The mission grade is much easier to see!</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/852.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">You can now sort your roster by level!</span></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/fff.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">-To quickly complete the mission with a 100% guaranteed success rate, press Complete Now!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">2. Item Shop</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">To make the Item Shop more convenient, items will now be sorted by Item Shop level and will have a free “Update List”. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoCommentText\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">※<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif;\">In this update, new items that can be purchased with Dimensional Tokens have been added and some changes have been applied to the list of previously available items.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: 'Verdana',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/cvv.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- You can now see prospective items available when you Rank Up your Item Shop! </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/fcc.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- The list of items can be found per level!</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/001.png\" style=\"font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- The free “Update List” function can now be utilized to help you buy the items you want! </span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\">Update Limit removed</span></strong></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; text-decoration: line-through;\">- The 10-use limit for the “Update List” function has been removed! </span></strong></span></span><br>\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #333333;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">※ On our latest update, this content was not added. We apologize for the confusion.</span><br>\n&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Improvements</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: normal;\">1.</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333; font-weight: normal;\"> Improvements in Uniform Store</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/002.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- Once you enter the improved Uniform Store, you will see the current price of Uniforms displayed on the screen!</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/003.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- You can also see all available Uniforms for your characters, with details regarding each selected Uniform on the right.</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/004.png\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8;\">- You can also see the changed character skills by the Uniform and preview them in one click!</span></span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"color: #333333;\">2. UI for Bonus Items have been added.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #0075c8; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>- If an item or a package includes Bonus Items (ex: Event tokens, etc.) it will now be shown separately for easier viewing.</strong><br>\n<!-- [if !supportLineBreakNewLine]--><br>\n<!--[endif]--></span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\">3. UI Changes for Menu: [Settings], [Uniform], [Team] options have been added.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; color: #333333; font-size: 12pt;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://c1.img.netmarble.kr/mobile/6N/2018/07/021923/005.png\" style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px;\"></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #333333;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: #333333;\">4. If you do not have enough Clear Tickets while clearing a stage, a pop-up message will appear so you will have the option to purchase more Clear Tickets.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff6c00;\">▣</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: #ff6c00;\"> Other Fixes</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\">The following issues have been fixed:</span></strong></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">1. Cull Obsidian’s Marvel’s <em>Avengers: Infinity War</em> uniform preview error has been fixed.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">2. An issue where a skill does not activate when using 1-Touch mode has been fixed. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">3. Fixed an issue with Hulk’s Marvel’s <em>Thor: Ragnarok</em> uniform’s skill that when activated, it sometimes moves Hulk out of the stage.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">4. The issue regarding World Boss Ultimate where the skill Blade Twister snares and inflicts damage on your selected character if the skill hits your Ally characters has been fixed.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">5. Fixed an issue where Hulkbuster and Iron Man’s skill does not activate at times.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">6. Fixed an issue where Angela’s Secret Wars: 1602 Witch Hunter Uniform does not apply first hit when using the skill “Entangle”.</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">7. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">Fixed the visual glitch in Alliance Conquest where if there’s a character with a Custom Gear from Team 1 that is defeated without being killed, then the Custom Gear effects from that character are shown as part of the Custom Gear effects for Team 2 in the same slot.</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Verdana; color: #000000;\">8. Fixed an issue where a skill tooltip appears when long pressing the Ultimate skill icon. </span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">9.&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: line-through;\">Fixed an issue where Spider-Man uses his Ultimate skill in World Boss mode when the World Boss Co-Op skill is used.</span>&nbsp;[Fixed on Server Patch </span></span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\">6/20 2:26 AM (UTC+0)</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">]</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; text-autospace: ideograph-numeric ideograph-other; word-break: keep-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">-&gt; Fixed an issue while using Jump Kick and Growing Pains as Giant-Man Modern uniform results in doubled cooldown times.</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Thank you, and we hope you enjoy our newest update!</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0cm; margin-bottom: .0001pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!-- [if !supportAnnotations]--></span></div>\n<span style=\"font-family: Verdana; font-size: 12pt;\"><!--[endif]--></span></div>\n</div>\n"
